@@ -8,6 +8,22 @@ package, not for somebody reading this repository's commit log.
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Fixed
+
+- Tool validation loads the CommonJS Ajv constructor explicitly in ESM runtimes, without relying on a synthetic named export.
+
+- Tool registry initialization uses the Ajv constructor export directly, avoiding failures when the default import has no nested default export.
+
+### Added
+
+- Rejected tool calls emit warning diagnostics naming the failing field and constraint without logging input values.
+
+- Tools with dynamic definitions validate each call against its current schema, caching validators by schema object identity.
+
+- Static tool calls with input that fails their declared schema now return a descriptive tool result before the executor runs.
+
+- Static tool schemas are checked at registration, so invalid JSON Schemas fail at startup with the tool name.
+
